{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107289","id":2576910254,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZmIeu","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107289","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107289.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107289.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107289","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107289/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107289/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107289/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d2814ebbf351a7e4f485c87c4c6c4bde285663a7","number":107289,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add missing Color hash function","user":{"login":"dementive","id":87823030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3ODIzMDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87823030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive","html_url":"https://github.com/dementive","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The Color type has no hash function in HashMapHasherDefault, it still works right now but it only works because color gets implicitly converted to a String.\r\n\r\nI had some code that was insanely slow for no good reason so I ran it through callgrind to figure out what was going on and I saw this in Kcachegrind:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e22a774-7ee4-46a4-9d52-d995496d1bb3)\r\n\r\n40 billion instructions from String allocations when doing Color HashMap lookups didn't really make any sense, Color should have nothing to do with String. So I looked into the HashMap lookup function and sure enough there was no Color hash function, which caused keys of Color type to get implicitly converted to a String and then it called the String hash function.\r\n\r\nJust by adding this Color hash function my startup time went from around 5 seconds to about half a second.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/g